      "cooked": "<p>Against Ambuscade Sonic Mines. Tempest had Twist the Ether. Tempest use Squall.</p><p>A) Tempest deals all non-hero targets 1+1 damage. Period.</p><p>B) Tempest deals Ambuscade 1+1 damage, Tempest deals Sonic Mines 1-1 damage, Tempest deals... etc etc.</p><p>Which is right?</p>",
