      "created_at": "2013-02-04T11:03:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well obviously in A you could also choose 1-1 to all, but I get your point.</p><p>My general understanding of how damage to multiple targets works (including official rulings on how&nbsp;it interacts with&nbsp;Wrest the Mind) says that it is scenario B.&nbsp; However, there is a really old ruling on BGG here: <a href=\"http://www.boardgamegeek.com/thread/700600/the-visionary\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.boardgamegeek.com/thread/700600/the-visionary</a>&nbsp;which says it is scenario A.</p>",
